  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in overall financial volatility cause dealers to reduce risk-taking and inventory provision while widening bid‑ask spreads, directly degrading depth and tradability in bond markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_hostilities</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_shock</data>
