  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased cross‑border incidents raise perceived supply‑chain and export‑control risks, prompting Chinese authorities and firms to accelerate subsidies, approvals and construction schedules for domestic chip fabs, expanding specialized chip production capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">12-36 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">china_tech_push</data>
</edge>
