  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">More frequent cross-border strikes and transnational incidents near key sea lanes prompt insurers and shipowners to reroute, delay or suspend tanker transits through affected chokepoints, directly reducing tanker volume.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_supply_shift</data>
