  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising likelihood of wider escalation incentivizes governments and producers with spare capacity to authorize and finance output increases and emergency export arrangements, directly accelerating the rate at which alternative crude supplies are ramped up.</data>
