  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in perceived escalation risk directly raises sovereign risk premia and term premiums (and can lift inflation risk premia via anticipated supply disruptions), pushing up long-term yields.</data>
