  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger, visibly coordinated allied responses (escorts, sanctions, information-sharing) lower market uncertainty about protection of flows and escalation management, directly reducing the perceived risk of fuel supply disruption.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_supply_shift</data>
