  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in specialised chip production directly increases availability of sensors, guidance and processing hardware for unmanned surface/air systems and naval electronics that states and proxies can deploy to carry out more frequent and sophisticated interdiction or harassment operations in chokepoints.</data>
