  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher long yields raise global borrowing costs and lower near-term growth and demand expectations in oil‑importing economies, exerting downward pressure on benchmark crude prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_bond_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_hostilities</data>
</edge>
