  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A faster ramp-up of credible alternative energy supplies reduces individual states' exposure to Russian leverage and thus makes collective sanctions and coordinated security measures politically and practically easier among allies.</data>
