  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher fuel prices raise on‑site energy, power purchase and transport costs for semiconductor manufacturing and its logistics, squeezing margins and prompting temporary production slowdowns or postponement of capacity additions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">energy_supply_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">china_tech_push</data>
