  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in fuel prices raise headline and core inflation expectations and prompt markets to price earlier or larger central-bank tightening, driving up long-term sovereign yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">energy_supply_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_shock</data>
</edge>
